  "title": "Hồng Đức Code (Quốc triều hình luật)",
  "summary": "Promulgated in 1483 by King Lê Thánh Tông, the Hồng Đức Code (Quốc Triều hình luật) is a Vietnamese law code of 722 articles in 13 chapters and 6 volumes, covering penal, civil, marriage and family law among other fields, and recognizing women’s civil legal capacity. It stayed in force during the Late Lê dynasty, more than 300 years.",
